node_modules
dist
.amy
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Build state, not source. tsc trusts these over the tree, so a fresh
# checkout with them committed skips emitting and every downstream package
# fails to find its types.
*.tsbuildinfo

# macOS leaves one of these in every directory it is browsed from.
.DS_Store

# What `sf check` learned about a finding somebody is already fighting with:
# every failed attempt and one diff that cleared the same rule elsewhere. A
# local trail for whoever is in that loop, kept out of the factory lock
# upstream for the same reason it is kept out of the history here.
.software-factory/escapes/
